#: river_water/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "WATER"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You wonder for a moment if your sink has overflowed, but that's not it at all—there's just a being made of water standing before you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She's ethereally beautiful, but there's something hard to pin down in her gaze. It almost feels like she's watching your every move, waiting to see what you'll do."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/22
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Hi honey. You looking to cook something? Wash your hands?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, actually. Here to see you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Didn't you get enough of me in the shower this morning?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why do I have to 'want' something?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Me? What could you possibly want with little old me?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Please, just tell me if there's anything I can do for you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Who could ever have enough of you, sweetheart?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Running down that perfect body is the highlight of my day."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But since you're the one who came to me I'd say you're the one who couldn't get enough."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "River"
msgid "So what can I do for you, sugar?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Everybody wants something. Just a matter of what."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "So just let me know what I can do for you, sweetheart."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing in particular. Maybe I could get your name?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You see me naked every day and I still don't even know your name."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was actually hoping to get your name."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What do you need my name for, cutie?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "There's plenty of more exciting things we could talk about."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's sexier that way, isn't it? You're the star, and I'm just me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Besides... it's better you don't know. Keeps the mystery."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What, little old me?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Better you don't know. Keeps the mystery."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've never been a big fan of mystery. Tell me your name!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You got something to hide?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-1/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not asking too much, is it?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "My, so demanding. Ah well."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Hide? What the hell have I got to hide?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Your body is 60% me. Who's hiding anything?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-1/c-7/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I always thought it was 70%."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "That statistic is <i>incorrect.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh, I suppose not."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Guess the mystery had to end sometime."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm River."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-2/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just 'River'? No last name?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Just River. Like 'Chair'."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/0/s/0 river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What, like the furniture?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Chair?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-3/3
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Chair. World-famous pop star. Known for her number one hit, Be-leaf."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-3/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not familiar."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-3/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ohh, THAT one."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-3/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It sounds strangely familiar and yet..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's a little surprising... everyone in this house knows Chair."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "The one and only."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "She's an icon. Just ask anyone."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/3
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You know, the best thing about Chair is she's always changing her look through the decades."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/11
msgctxt "River"
msgid "She always knew just what we wanted to see and served it to us."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/19
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I really admire that about her."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You wish you could be someone else?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She has the range, darling."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's never too late to reinvent yourself."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Not... someone else."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/c-13/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But being your best self all the time... it must be nice."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "She does."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/c-14/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I wish I did too."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/c-15/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I change states all day every day."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/c-15/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I know that better than anyone."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-4/c-15/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I just wish I knew which one was best for me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Is there a version of me you like best?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Water... steam... ice... some form in between?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're really putting me on the spot here."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course there is."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-5/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't make your insecurities my problem."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-5/c-16/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh... sorry."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "'Of course'?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-5/c-17/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...oh god, don't tell me now."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-5/c-17/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'll just be thinking about it all the time."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I wasn't... god."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River wasn't exactly holding your gaze before, but she seems intensely uncomfortable now."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks everywhere but at you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...look, I've been here way too long."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "If you don't need anything from me I'm going to go."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-6/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well alright-"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-6/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you say so-"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-6/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please, wait-"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_intro/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She is gone."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you come across River again, she's got company—a glamorous companion in an equally glamorous bathrobe and that effortless sort of wet hair look."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/14/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You recognize your bathtub, Bathsheba."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/15/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You hear River call her Bathsheba—she appears to be your bathtub."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/24
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Come on girl, it's just the two of us! You don't have to play coy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/32
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You can't be all over this house and not have some good gossip."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/40
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't... that's not really..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/51
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Come onnnn, you can tell your girl Sheba!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/59
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You know I won't tell."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/67
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River's eyes dart to you suddenly, and you're not sure whether she's angry or relieved."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/75/b/1
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oooh, hello... we'll have to get acquainted another time, but..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/75/b/9
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Well, maybe if you won't talk to ME you'll talk to them."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/78/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did I come at a bad time?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/79/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoah."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Noooo, not at all! Come here."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh it's about to be EVERYTHING."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't know what you think is going on-"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Nothing! Just a little kiki between us bath girlies!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba throws her arm around River, pulling her closer—you can see River's cheeks flushing."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Steam rises from her skin in a light mist—it's sort of adorable."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Look, since we've got a new friend here with us, I'll let you choose."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Our friend River here likes to pretend she's above things like 'gossip', and 'opinions'."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "And I KNOW that's not true."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Why, just the other day I caught her rolling her eyes at Prissy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh... oh."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Your plastic plant!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well that was just-"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "And the other day when Jean Loo was working on a song I KNOW I heard her laughing."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jean Loo?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Your toilet. Aspiring rapper. Interesting gent."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I wasn't-"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "AND! Everytime you leave Winnifred she's got you all steamed up."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who now?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That doesn't sound great..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Your water heater, honey."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Don't ask me about her!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Don't sweat it, Riv. Look, I'll let you off easy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Just one little cup of tea. Your friend's choice."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "That's fair, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-3/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River looks as if, to her, this is the farthest thing from fair, but she knows there's no wriggling out of it now."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-3/35
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...fine."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-3/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gimme the toilet tea."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-3/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Talk to me about the plant."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_1/0/g-3/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's hear about the water heater."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "First of all, let's all agree to never say the phrase 'toilet tea' ever again."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/11
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Second, YEAH! Let's hear about Jean Loo!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/19
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Give us the tea on Lil' Crapper!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River purses her lips."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/35
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You know that song he's been working on, 'She Yank My Handle 'Til My Tube, She Overflow?'"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/43
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Uh huh."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River's gaze darts back and forth between you and Bathsheba, looking for some sign before she continues."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You could help her out."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/70/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds awful."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/71/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds amazing."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well go on."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River exhales, all the tension leaving her shoulders."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's TERRIBLE. JUST AWFUL."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Ohohoho, there she is."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River seems to grow bolder from your encouragement."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "River"
msgid "He should try changing his name to something that actually fits."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/55
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Lil' Crapper? More like... Big Mistake."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/63
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "HAHAHA! That's more like it!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/71
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You got any more?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/79
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Lil' Dude No One's Ever Heard of... Yung Basement Dweller... TWT - Toilet Without Talent..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/87
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh my god you've just been sitting on these."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/95
msgctxt "River"
msgid "N-no, I just... they just came to mind, that's all."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're very creative."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sound like a hater to me..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should give us rap names too."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't know about that... but thank you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm not... I shouldn't have said anything."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Well what fun would that have been!? No, no. Let your inner hater out!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-2/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oooh yes, lay it on us."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-2/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River thinks for a few moments. She points at Bathsheba first."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-2/26
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Queen B."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-2/34
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oohhh yes yes yes! You are just SO good at this."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-2/42
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River points a finger at herself, not looking at you or Bathsheba as she speaks."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-2/53
msgctxt "River"
msgid "GF - Goddess of Flow."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-2/61
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oooh, yes! And a cute double entendre."
