#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-0/103/c-2/85
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Yes... get to know each other better..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh, uh. It is. I think he's got a real hit on his valves."
