#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Uh..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "He's... trying."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Come on, that isn't gossip!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You never caught him doing anything weird? Canoodling with a plunger?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "That's not really any of my business..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh booo! Come on now..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You don't have to be so distant and mysterious all the time, you know!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Just tell us how you really feel!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "River"
msgid "That's how I feel, sorry."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/_river_gossip_toilet/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Well that's no fun..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/0 river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/17
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River's demeanor seems to shift immediately—it's like she can barely keep from rolling her eyes."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I just think it's... interesting... that a plastic plant would need to be watered."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/24
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Interesting how?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Just... interesting."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You do know I'm the one who waters her, right?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem a little offended."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I should start watering her twice a day."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...I know that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Ohhh no, did we hit a touchy subject?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "We could talk about somebody else!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "River"
msgid "We've talked enough."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm not saying I'm offended..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's just... when my water slides down her leaves and gathers in the pot until it gets nasty..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Eww, that is pretty nasty. Why do you water a plastic plant anyway?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I heard it was a good habit."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She looks prettier with her leaves moistened."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's it to you?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Maybe you could just sing to her instead."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm sure she'd be just as happy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good idea."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't really need your advice here."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Thank you..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Excuse me, then."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Well if it's to make <i>her</i> look <i>prettier</i>."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh boy... you really can't read the room, can you?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-1/34/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Nothing. Nothing at all."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River jerks back as though she's been slapped, her pretty face absolutely wreathed in aquatic rage."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Twice a day?! So you can waste more water!?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-2/26
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Ohohoho, what a boneheaded thing to say."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-2/34
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Some people have ZERO personal awareness, am I right, Riv?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-2/42
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba playfully elbows River, but River ignores her entirely."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-2/53
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You can do whatever you want... but don't be surprised if you run out of water when you come back for round two."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_plant/0/c-2/61
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Somebody's in trouble!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "That doesn't mean anything..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Sure it does!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She might just be embarrassed by the attention."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/17/s/0 river_water/river_friend_reject/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're assuming a lot."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You did seem a little flustered when the water heater came up."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/c-0/7 river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/106
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Pfft, what attention? This is just three friends having a chat!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Now tell us..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Y-yeah..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Not at all! That's why I'm asking!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I just need some clarification."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Yeah! What's up with you and Winnifred?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You two an item or what?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "N-no... not an item."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "But you ARE bangalangin', right? You can tell us!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't pressure her, Bathsheba."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They must be—why else is she so embarrassed?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on... tell us something really juicy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I'm not pressuring her!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I'm just reminding her that good friends like us tell each other EVERYTHING!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/23
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "ESPECIALLY juicy gossip!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/31
msgctxt "River"
msgid "There's nothing to tell."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/39
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Ohh right, okay. Sure. I see what's going on here."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/47
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You gotta preserve the River mystery... your brand is being sexy and cool and untouchable. Mm-hm, mm-hm."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/55
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Say no more, say no more."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/63
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Whatever you say..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/71
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River looks extremely grateful for your intervention. Bathsheba only sighs."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/82
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "The facts are the facts, though... River goes to see Winnifred and comes back all hot and bothered and heated."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/90
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Buuuut if you're not gonna comment you're not gonna comment."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-3/98
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I can take a hint! If there's one thing I know how to do it's read a room, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-4/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "There are lots of reasons to be embarrassed when someone corners you and asks you about private things."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-4/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "But that's not what we're doing! It's just a little friendly gossip! Lighten up!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-5/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...I don't know what you want from me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-5/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Winnifred and I's relationship is special. Private."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-5/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's not gossip fodder."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-5/31
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh. Is that what you think we're doing here? Oh, no, no!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-5/39
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "We were just trying to understand what's going on, that's all!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_gossip_heater/0/g-0/32/c-5/47 river_water/river_love_path/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_good/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River seems more relaxed than you've seen her, but when your eyes meet it's like she remembers she's meant to be a bit more distant."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_good/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her smile vanishes, and she clears her throat nervously."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_good/22
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Uh. Well. Just one question before I go."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_good/30 river_water/gossip_join_bad/22
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What do you think is my best state?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_good/38
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh well, you're just so pretty all the time... But you know, you're so fun when you're liquid, mm-hm!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_good/46 river_water/gossip_join_bad/38
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "After all, who doesn't love a good bath?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_good/54 river_water/gossip_join_bad/46
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_good/62 river_water/gossip_join_bad/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River leaves without another word, not bothering to say goodbye to you or Bathsheba."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_good/76
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Woah, woah, woah, woah, hey! Wait up, Riv!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_bad/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River is positively boiling, but somehow she doesn't explode. She just takes a quiet breath, exhaling and centering herself."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_bad/14
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Just one question before I go."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_bad/30
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh you're just so pretty all the time... but you know you're so fun when you're liquid!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_bad/68
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Whoah, hey! What did I do wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/gossip_join_bad/76
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Wait up, Riv!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The room feels oddly humid when you walk in—almost as if you'd just finished running the shower."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The reason soon becomes clear, however—you see River speaking with someone on fire... or made of fire, anyway."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Steam rises from River's skin, filling the room with warm air."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/33
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "You really gotta learn to relax, homie."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/44
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I can relax just fine."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/52
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Just please tell me how to be more likeable."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/60
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "Well I don't know if I can do that..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/68
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I heard you telling Scandalabra how to up his game yesterday."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/79
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "Yeah and dude did NOT like that one bit."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/87
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "I've never seen him so huffy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/95
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "He was all like \"Merde! You impugn my skills at le sexe!?\""
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/103
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "I was like \"no bro, I'm just tryin' to tell ya there's a better way.\""
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/111
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "He didn't even let me get into my theory or anything."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/119
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "But yeah, like... I can tell ya how to talk to others more effectively."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/127
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "But I don't think I can give you some magic key to being likeable."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/135
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River seems deeply disappointed by this response."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/143
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Can you tell me one thing then?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/151
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Which version of me do you think is the best?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/159
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "Well, not the 'best', all of you is great. But if I had to choose..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/167
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "I mean, who doesn't like a little steam?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/175
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "It's 'steamy', you know? Totally sexy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/183
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "If you lead with steam, you really can't go wrong romantically."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/191
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/199
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dante gives you a friendly wave as he leaves. When he's gone, the room feels colder."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/220
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Hey. You weren't listening to that, were you?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/228/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might have been."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/229/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's none of my business."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/230/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why would I care about your conversation?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "... god. Just forget whatever you heard, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Please."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Well... thanks for saying so."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But really, please don't worry about it, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...yeah, you're right."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Just, if you did hear anything weird... please forget about it, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River runs a hand through her flowing hair, as if it might restore her dignity. Her expression changes to something a bit cheerier... and hollower."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Now, what can I do for you, honey?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You must have come here for a reason."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "This conversation is too familiar—she's clearly going through a routine."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why can't you be the reason?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just wanted to get to know you better."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought maybe we could hang out."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's just not realistic."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm... not used to hearing that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You actually want to hang out with me?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm usually the means to an end."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You wanna wash your hands? A quick in and out."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You want to cook? Fill a pot with water and assemble your ingredients, the real star of the show."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Even when you want a bath... I mean, Bathsheba is the main attraction there."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I help make the bath happen, but it's about the vibes. The comfort. The soak."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And I mean, that's fine! Don't get me wrong."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's better that way. But just don't be surprised if I'm... surprised."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For all the times I've been vulnerable around you I thought you'd be more comfortable by now."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about going swimming?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a crucial part of all those experiences, though."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Vulnerable?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know... naked?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You basically see me at my worst all the time."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hello? The bathroom?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Well..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/15 river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River's cheeks are steaming again."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't keep track of that kind of thing. I'm just doing my job."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/31 river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-1/31 river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-2/31 river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-7/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I work really hard, you know. And yet..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well, I don't know... I think you look cute when you're tired. And naked."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And it's my job to help you during those times."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Well, I guess... but that's just part of my job."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Please don't think I'm judging you when you're naked and vulnerable."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-2/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm a professional."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...I guess."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But most of my day isn't really that. Especially not with you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...am I?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I guess if I was gone they'd be... a little bit harder to pull off."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Nobody ever seems grateful to have me around."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "When I'm gone, or late, or not the way people want me to be, though..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Nobody has a problem complaining about it then."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "All I want is to know what exactly people want from me so I can give it to them."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "If you don't want anything from me, and you can't give me that..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What, you're just going to leave?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want you to stay and talk to me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Chasing everyone else's approval isn't going to make you happy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...I have a lot of work to do around this house, you know."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-9/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Just tell me what you want or I'm gone."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-9/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want you to stay and talk."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-9/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want you to stop being so wishy-washy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-9/29/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want you to do what you want to do."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-9/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...alright."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-9/29/c-1/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River simply leaves without another word."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-9/29/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "That doesn't help me!!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-9/29/c-2/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River leaves in a huff, without another word to you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well I guess that's... something."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Easy for you to say. You're yourself no matter where you go."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-11/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You have no idea what it's like for someone like me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-11/29
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You just want me to be myself like I'm not literally changing at the molecular level all day every day all over this fucking house."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-11/40
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But sure, ok! I'll just do what I want to do, which is apparently standing here and talk to you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-11/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River seems to be almost talking herself down from this angry little ledge she's on. She folds her arms over her chest, looking away from you for a good while."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-2/c-11/56
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eventually she exhales, seemingly more relaxed than she'd been."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "So what do you want to talk about then?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just have a regular conversation."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me something about you no one else knows."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know, entertain me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "A regular conversation..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-12/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River stares at you in an evaluating silence, as though she might pick up some hint from your blank face. Eventually she sighs."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-12/29
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Okay. Did you catch the last episode of that TV show we were all watching?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "This throws River—it takes her a little while to speak, but she does consider your request."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/33
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...I love to paint."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/41
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Watercolor, of course."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/49
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't have much time for it, but... it's one of the things that makes me happiest."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you could show me your work sometime?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Even Winnifred doesn't know?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's so cute."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Ahhh I don't know! Don't ask me that!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-0/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I shouldn't have even said that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-0/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm just gonna go, BYE!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well, yeah. Though admittedly..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River looks elsewhere, unable to meet your gaze."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-1/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't suppose we'd have time for that when she's doing what she does."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-1/31
msgctxt "River"
msgid "A-anyway! I've got somewhere to be, so I'm gonna go."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-1/39
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Thanks... this was nice."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-1/47
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Maybe we can talk again later?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well... I'm glad you think so."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-2/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Just don't go around telling anyone, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-2/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It'll be our secret."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-2/31
msgctxt "River"
msgid "God, I can't believe I said that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-2/39
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm gonna go. BYE!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-14/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Entertain you?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-14/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She stares at you, vapor rising from her skin as she quietly fumes."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-14/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What, do you want me to do a little dance for you? Sing you a little song?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_2/0/g-3/c-14/40
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's not enough that I do what I do for you all day every day?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't really watch tv."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah, which show was that again?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Unfortunately no."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Well... neither do I."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...I don't... know."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/c-2/7 river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Okay."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You and River stand in an uncomfortable silence. She winds a flowing strand of hair around one finger, fidgeting nervously."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Um... you listen to any good music lately?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing you'd have heard of."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I haven't really been feeling much lately."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah, you heard Bussy Galore's latest? He's really shaking the table."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Ah."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...I don't know who or what that is."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Another deeply uncomfortable silence. Perhaps you should help her out."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What did you do today?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Got any fun plans this week?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Where are you headed after this?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Well, I started my day with your shower, of course."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Had to see Winnifred for that. Then I had to make some ice with Freddy..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Then I went to see Sinclaire because he's leaking and I'm tired of him summoning me for no reason."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/31
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Then I had to go see Washford about the laundry."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/39
msgctxt "River"
msgid "After that I should have a little free time... unless someone needs me, which they probably will."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You do so much, River."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't you ever do anything fun?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So much relies on you in this house..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-0/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Kinda, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-0/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And it's fine, it's my job."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-0/29
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I just want to be appreciated, too."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-0/37
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And if I knew what people liked the most about me... maybe I'd see a little more of that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-0/45
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Anyway, I've got places to be, so I gotta go."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-0/53
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She pauses."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-0/61
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But um, thanks. It was nice talking to you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-1/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What, like this fucking conversation?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't mean it rudely."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-1/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nobody's making you stay."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-1/21/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I guess..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-1/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I've got a lot to do, so I'm gonna go."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-1/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River doesn't even respond to you, she just turns and leaves."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-1/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't have time to waste on this."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-2/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Yeah... and that's fine, I'm happy to do my job."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-2/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Just wish people would make it a little easier for me, that's all."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-2/29
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But since they won't... I'm just gonna have to figure it out for myself."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-2/37
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Anyway, I've got to go. But... thanks."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-2/45
msgctxt "River"
msgid "This was nice. We should do it again soon."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Not really. I just go where I'm needed."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't really make time for myself like that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's a real shame."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should try it sometime."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't make yourself into a martyr."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I guess. But not much I can do about it now."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Thanks, though."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/29
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I've gotta run, but it was nice talking with you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/37
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Maybe we'll do it again sometime."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-1/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I wish I could, but I don't see that happening anytime soon."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-1/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Thanks, though. At least talking to you was nice."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-1/29
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I gotta run, but... maybe we could do this again later?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-1/37
msgctxt "River"
msgid "See ya around."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-2/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Who's doing that? I'm just being honest."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-2/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But since my <i>martyrdom</i> is so hard for you to take I'll just spare you and leave."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'll probably see if anyone needs anything—maybe rest a little bit before somebody else asks me for something."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do people summon you so often?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope you get to rest up."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's kinda sad..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/c-0/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well yeah. There's pipes all over this house, and everyone needs water for all kinds of things."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/c-0/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Everyone just assumes I'll be there, immediately, just how they want me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/c-0/29
msgctxt "River"
msgid "So I just run around all the time."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/c-0/37
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Speaking of which, I'm gonna get back to it."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/c-0/45
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But it was nice talking to you. Maybe we'll do it again later."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/c-1/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Thank you. Doubt it, but I'll try."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/c-1/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm gonna go but... thanks."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/c-2/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well that's my life. Sorry it bothers you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/regular_conversation/0/g-1/c-8/15/c-2/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm gonna get back to my sad routine."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River seems to have no shortage of visitors whenever you run into her. This time her companion is a statuesque figure in black."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/21/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Something about her gives you a strange sense of nostalgia and sadness."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/21/b/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her name appears to be Lady Memoria, but you can't quite figure out who or what she is."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/22/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You recognize Lady Memoria right away."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/28
msgctxt "Lady Memoria"
msgid "Don't concern yourself with the opinions of those beneath you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/39
msgctxt "Lady Memoria"
msgid "There is only one real answer to your question to begin with."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/47
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/55
msgctxt "Lady Memoria"
msgid "Ice, my dear."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/63
msgctxt "Lady Memoria"
msgid "Ice preserves perfectly. It leaves everything just as it should be, forever beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/71
msgctxt "Lady Memoria"
msgid "That aside, a lady never allows herself to boil over."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/79
msgctxt "Lady Memoria"
msgid "Do not let them see you crack. Do you understand?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/87
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...yeah."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/95
msgctxt "Lady Memoria"
msgid "Excellent."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/103
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Memoria breezes out of the room, not even looking your way—perhaps she didn't see you, or perhaps she's just lost in her own thoughts."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/120
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River doesn't seem at all encouraged by Memoria's advice. When she sees you she starts for a moment, then sighs."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/128 river_water/river_love_path/0/41
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh... hey."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/136/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What was that all about?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/137/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem down."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/138/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What're you moping about?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh, nothing... just wanted to see what Memoria thinks about me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I just want to be my best... and nobody is helping."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Everyone I talk to has a different opinion about which version of me they like best."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Nobody has said the same thing."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What am I supposed to do with 10 different answers?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just count them up and average them."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you tried just being yourself?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just choose the one you like best."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But somebody will be unhappy no matter what that way."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And that's the exact thing I'm trying to avoid!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh like it's just sooo easy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What would you know about that?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "That's not how it works for me!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I want to know what people like best so I can just be that!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I can't even <i>help</i> changing, you know."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Even if I did have a preference for one state, I'm always gonna have to be something else."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "So there's no point in putting myself out there like that just to be told I'm not good enough anyway."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know it's not easy, but..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you ever thought about trying harder?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like you just the way you are—no matter what state that is."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It really isn't."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But I guess it's always been this way and it always will be."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Only every single day of my fucking life."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But thanks, really, for that advice."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...thanks."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River falls silent, perhaps thinking over what you've said to her... or perhaps turning over everyone else's words."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She sits, drawing her knees up to her chest and looking off into the distance—whatever is on her mind, it's plain to see she's a thousand miles away."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll leave you alone."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you mind if I sit?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you had too much work to do to be sitting around..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...wait."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/c-9/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Would you stay?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/c-9/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/c-9/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think I should."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/c-9/29/c-1/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River says nothing else to you—it's more than clear it's time to leave."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "No... go ahead."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_encounter_3/0/g-2/c-11/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River ignores you, though you can see her expression grow darker—your words may have hit home."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not sure why you're still here, truthfully—but something in you feels compelled to stay."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes a while for River to speak, but when she does it's clear she's hurt."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/16/b/1
msgctxt "River"
msgid "We've known each other your whole life. Guess I was expecting more from you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/17/b/1
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I guess I was hoping for a little more from a friend."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/18/b/1
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I really don't know why I thought I'd get anything helpful out of you... but it still hurts."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you keep expecting someone else to solve your insecurities, you're going to be disappointed."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wish I could help, but only you can handle this."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, River."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You're so right. That'll be the last time I make that fucking mistake."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River says nothing more to you, but she doesn't have to. The conversation is over."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I can't handle it! I really can't."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River covers her face with her hands and begins quietly to cry."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You've not seen her so vulnerable before—it's hard to watch."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Just sit with her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please don't cry."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Leave her to her sorrows.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you walk away from River you can't really shake the feeling that you might have lost the opportunity to really connect... but it's not your problem, is it?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River doesn't speak, she doesn't look at you. Perhaps this torrent of emotions has been a long time coming."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Gone is the hollow, shifty, at-your-service personality you're used to."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But as hard as it is to see, it is real."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When River finally speaks, her voice is a bit hoarse."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I can't even look at you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Why'd you stay? What do you get out of seeing me like this?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friends are there for each other even when things get ugly."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It may not be pretty, but it's real."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like seeing you miserable."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...no matter what, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...yeah. I guess it is, isn't it."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/c-8/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River doesn't even look at you, but you can see the steam rising from her skin in small clouds."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/c-8/19
msgctxt "River"
msgid "<i>Just go.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-1/c-8/30 river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-2/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a finality in her tone that lets you know... whatever relationship you may have been building is all over now."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River sighs, finally standing. Her face is streaked with tears, but she seems less tightly wound than before."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I guess you know the real me now... just a watery mess. Whatever everyone needs me to be... nothing on my own."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Thanks for stickin' around... I think."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I... I need to think. And I got work I should do."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_unhappy_talk/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'll see you later."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I never thought someone could see the worst sides of me and stick around. I'm so glad you're still here."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm lucky to have a friend like you help me figure this out."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/2/b/1
msgctxt "River"
msgid "To be honest I'm not really sure why you keep coming back... but I appreciate you being here anyway."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We might be just getting to know each other, but..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know what it's like to feel lost."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're way too much but you're still hot."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...it's funny you say that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I know you so intimately."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But you have no idea about me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't understand how... you're always you no matter where you go."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You don't get to your job and somebody tells you to hurry up and change."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Changing yourself all day every day really takes a toll on you, you know."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh yeah? Well. Glad I'm still good for <i>something</i>."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-2/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River stands, giving you a look that chills you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-2/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well if that's all you've got to say I'm gonna head out. Lots to do."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/c-2/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River turns away from you, but you can see the steam rising from her skin in small clouds."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's so much easier to just hide behind whatever you think I am."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Whatever you want me to be."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "'What can I do for you, sugar?' Everyone likes that River."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What happens when you see all the ugly parts of me?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What do we do when you know it's all lies?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Get to know the messy, <i>real</i> River."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Walk in the other direction as fast as I can."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We start over with something real."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...what if you don't like her?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Real funny."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Seriously, what happens if you don't like the real me?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But what if it's not the same? What if you hate me?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not everyone will like you and that's okay."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell, you might hate me too."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-1/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "At least that dislike will be something real."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...I want to believe you. But that part still scares me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River laughs—you've never seen her look so sincerely amused."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Maybe... maybe not."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Yeah... you're right."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well, thanks for listening. I gotta think about all of this."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm clearly not gonna find any answers in asking everybody else."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She sighs."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...guess it's all on me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_happy_talk/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "See ya later."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/6 river_water/river_friend_path/0/0 river_water/river_hate_path/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River is alone when you come to see her—for the first time since the two of you met this way."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/14 river_water/river_friend_path/0/8 river_water/river_hate_path/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But that's not the only unusual thing here. There's something in the air you've not really sensed until now..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She seems at ease, her body posture relaxed as she looks around the room."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When she sees you she smiles—you've never seen such a beatific expression on her face."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/49
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm so glad you're here. I was just thinking about you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was thinking about you too."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Aww, that's sweet."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Nothing really."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I just wanted to thank you for our conversation the other day."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Nobody's ever really seen all of me, you know."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not even Winnifred?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It hurts me to hear that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Winnifred has seen me at my most vulnerable, but even she hasn't seen the ugliest sides of me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I always leave before things get too real. Someone always needs hot water for something."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I was just afraid of what they'd think if they knew who I really was."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "That I couldn't be loved... or even liked."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It hurts to live it. I just thought I was protecting myself."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "There's so many different Rivers... you know, beyond even my different states."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I just become whatever people want from me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Nobody's ever really known the real me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Some of them think they do, but they don't."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I just thought if I could just be my best self at all times, everyone would love me then... but it made me so sad and resentful."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's so tiring performing all the time, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've been there myself."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You shouldn't have to do that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely. It's time to retire."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm so sorry you had to do that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I wouldn't have guessed... you seem so comfortable being yourself."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's hard to avoid it in some ways... but I know I made it worse for myself."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You're right. I can't stop it entirely..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "To some extent this will always be me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Changing my state is out of my hands. It's—it's who I am."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But... I don't have to change <i>me</i>."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Does that make sense?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-2/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not sure I understand."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-2/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Perfectly."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-2/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean like your personality?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "That's okay. It took me a bit to wrap my mind around it too."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm so glad you know what I mean."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Yes, exactly."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Yes, somebody might like some other version of me more."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Sure, someone may need me in another state to get the job done."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But all those states are still me. Liquid, solid, vapor, whatever."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's all still me... it's like the legend Aqua Khan once said..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "'I'm every water—it's all in me.'"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like I remember that song lyric a little differently..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wise words."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It is all in you!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Pretty sure that's exactly how it goes. Anyway..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Aren't they?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She exhales, as if steadying herself."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Anyway... I don't think I could have had this breakthrough without you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You watched me question myself and everybody around me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I didn't even realize it at the time, but I really let you see the neediest, worst parts of me, and you didn't even care."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I know you well, but you barely know me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/40
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And still, you let me be me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her smile grows warmer—there's a new tenderness in her gaze."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/56
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It means a lot to me. More than I can express."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/64
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She reaches her hand out to you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/72
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I know you intimately... but you've never gotten to know me like that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/80
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I just want to show you... everything. All of me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/88
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Would you like to take a bath with me?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/96/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd rather just get to know you, River."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/97/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like that a lot."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/98/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just want to be friends."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-15/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River seems surprised, but the smile returns to her face rather quickly."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-15/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "In that case... maybe we could paint together?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-15/23/b/1
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You know I love watercolor... I thought it would be nice if we did it together."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-15/24/b/1
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Nobody really knows this, but... I love watercolor."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-15/27
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I've never shared my art with anyone, but... I'd love to share it with you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-15/35/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do it."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-15/35/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd rather just watch you if that's okay."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-17/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Well... I'd like that too."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-17/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "To have a friend like you who accepts me for who I am... I'm really lucky."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-17/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It might take me some time, but I'm gonna keep working on being comfortable as my real self... and I know with your friendship I can make it."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_path/0/g-4/c-17/34
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Thank you for everything."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_bath/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River smiles, taking you by the hand, and as she leads you off to the bath you know nothing will ever be the same between you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_bath/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's not as if the bath itself is a novel experience—but this time it feels like the bath is taking you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_bath/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The water is perfectly warm, caressing you in your most intimate places with a touch that's both gentle and bold."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_bath/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's no doubt that when the night ends, the two of you know each other more intimately than you could ever have imagined."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_bath/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River is such a constant presence in your day in so many ways—she might be ever-changing, but knowing that she feels safe enough to be her truest self with you means the world."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River sets up some colors for the two of you, and while you do your best to paint a masterpiece, it's difficult to concentrate while she works next to you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You never imagined she was hiding such talent. The way the colors just flow across the page... it's like something right out of a museum."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River doesn't seem to mind your eyes on her, though she laughs when she notices just how slowly you work as a result."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you're done, you officially present each other with your work. You've chosen to paint..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's you!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a sunset."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's... abstract"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Wow... it actually does look like me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/c-0/15 river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/c-3/7 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Thank you so much."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh yes, I see it. It's really beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It's definitely abstract. But it is really beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I can tell you painted from the heart."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River reveals her artwork to you, and it's truly stunning—she's painted flowers, simple but powerful in their beauty."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/14 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/54
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I know it probably seems a little cliche... but you know, I really love flowers."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/22 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/62
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Tending to flowers is one of my favorite things to do."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/30 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/70
msgctxt "River"
msgid "So many things need water, but flowers never ask for too much."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And when you give them a little love, they really blossom."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/46 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/86
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I guess in this case I'm the flowers and you're the water, hehe."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/54/s/0 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/94/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is beautiful, River."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/55/s/0 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/95/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're adorable."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/56/s/0 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/96/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I never knew you were such an artist."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/c-4/7 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh God, stop... I can't look at you when you say stuff like that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-0/c-5/7 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't know about all that... but I'm so glad you like it."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-1/3 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm not all that great at expressing myself... so I hope when you look at this you'll understand just a little of the way I feel for you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_together/0/g-1/11 river_water/river_paint_solo/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I look forward to continuing to show you the real me... no matter what state I'm in."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_solo/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River sets up her colors and begins to paint, her hands moving with beautiful, fluid strokes."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_solo/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's a true joy to watch a skilled artist at work, and River is no different."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_solo/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The way the colors just flow across the page... it's like something right out of a museum."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_solo/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not sure how much time passes as you watch, but River finally turns to you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_solo/0/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Alright. You've been watching so it won't be too much of a reveal... but here you are."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_solo/0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River hands her artwork over to you, and it's truly stunning—she's painted flowers, simple but powerful in their beauty."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_paint_solo/0/78
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And when you give them a little love they really blossom."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks happier than you've seen her since you first met."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh hey! Nice to see you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem happy."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You get some good news?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Yeah! I mean, I'm doing alright."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Huh? No, not really."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Nothing much, really."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Just been thinking."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You know, I've been trying to figure out what it is people want from me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And I asked so many people how they liked me best... and they all said different things, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But a lot of them like me best in my liquid state."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And that's probably how I spend the most time."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "So really... I guess I was worrying for nothing."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I told you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well I'm glad it worked out in the end."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like it would be better to just love yourself as you are..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You did, you did."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But it's why I'm so glad you're here."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "It did, didn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But It had a lot to do with you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "That's just not realistic."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But listen, I'm glad you're here."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't think I could have come to this conclusion without your support."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You never made me feel bad about who I am."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I feel like you'd be cool to me no matter what state I'm in, and I like that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Everyone's always got an opinion, but you never pushed one on me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I felt like well... at least I know one person won't ask me to change."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "River"
msgid "And knowing that really made all the difference."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It kinda feels like I didn't do anything..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll take credit for this, sure."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looks like my job here is done."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I guess you didn't, but... that's the whole point, really."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Good, because I'm giving it to you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Not quite!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I might not be searching for my ideal form anymore, but I need a friend like you in my life."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "With all the change I go through on a daily basis having someone as stable and steady as you around... it's nice, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I hope we can keep up this friendship we've built."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/24/s/0 river_water/river_love_return/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping to be more than friends..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm good honestly."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh good!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Don't worry about things like showers or baths or whatever."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-9/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm a professional—that stuff is just part of the job."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-9/31
msgctxt "River"
msgid "From now on you and I are just gonna be good friends."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-9/39 river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She offers you her hand, and when you take it she gives it a good firm shake."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-9/50 river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Here's to a beautiful friendship... solid, liquid, or gas, we'll be... uh, solid."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh... uh, sorry."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm good on that front."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-10/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Friendship is all I've got for you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-10/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friends it is, then."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-10/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess we're done here, then."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_path/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm so glad to hear you say it."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_reject/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River's expression grows dark, but for once there is no cute, angry blush that steams her cheeks. Her eyes remind you of a storm-tossed sea."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_reject/0/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh, my friendship's not good enough for you?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_reject/0/19
msgctxt "River"
msgid "So all that support was just a lie you dropped the minute I wasn't what you wanted me to be?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_reject/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't say that."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_reject/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pretty much, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_reject/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You didn't have to fucking say it."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_reject/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Of course. Of course."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_reject/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm not assuming <i>shit</i>. I can see what's right in front of me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A quiet, simmering resentment."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. It's you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What do <i>you</i> want?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's your problem?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There you go again assuming I want something from you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean, this is <i>my</i> house..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well because you obviously do!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh, <i>excuse</i> me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You walk around here like some kind of god, demanding I jump to serve you at every turn."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Demanding I <i>change</i> for you all day every day."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "No appreciation for what I do... no idea the toll it takes on me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You think I'm just some household object?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I'm a fucking <i>ELEMENT</i>. I'm a force of nature."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I was here long before you and I will be here long after you die."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't understand where all this is coming from..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Blah blah big deal. You're still in MY pipes."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok then."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Don't pretend you don't know!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh my god SHUT UP!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You are UNBEARABLE!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "At every turn you've been judgmental and unsupportive!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You saw me lost and confused and sad and what did you do?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You made me feel WORSE about myself!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You saw an element in pain and instead of helping, or even staying quiet, you decided to make things as bad as possible for me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't really remember it happening that way..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well it was funny, so..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't really think your insecurities are my problem."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I don't care about what you think happened."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I was there. I know what went down."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You're disgusting."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_path/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh don't worry, they'll never be your problem again after today."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_ending/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You really are just like everyone else."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_ending/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I can't believe I thought you were different."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_ending/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Don't ever fucking ask me for a goddamn thing."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_ending/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Your showers will be cold and your water pressure inconsistent."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_ending/32
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You will <i>never</i> be comfortable around me again."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_ending/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "True to her word, River's anger has an immediate impact on your daily life."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_ending/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "One minute your water pressure is non-existent, the next it's too much—even something as mundane as washing your hands becomes a test of your reflexes lest you be soaked."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_ending/56
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your showers are no longer pleasant places to contemplate the day's events... all you can think of is the way things ended between you and River."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_ending/64
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As the water pelting your back alternates between hot and cold, you wonder if it could have been different... but you've made your water bed, and now you have to lie in it."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_ending/106
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Cold shower? My kinda romance."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Hey there gorgeous—just can't get enough?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Never."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Never. In fact, I'm ready to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Hehe... well neither can I."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I've got somewhere else in the house to be, but maybe we can meet up again in the tub later?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_return/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just wanted to see that pretty smile."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_return/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You're gonna make me steam... you're way too sweet."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_return/0/c-0/23/c-0/15 river_water/river_love_return/0/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Hate to run, but see you again soon, cutie."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_return/0/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Mmm... me too."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Hey friend! Hope you're having a good one."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am... and I'm ready to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Always a good day when I see you doing well."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Aww, you. Get outta here with all that!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You're gonna turn me into syrup with all that sweet talk."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "I've got somewhere else to be, but let's hang later, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_return/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course, friend."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_friend_return/0/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "See you again soon!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What the fuck do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... I wanted to say hi to water?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "River, please... being at odds with you is killing me. (USE EMPATHY CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "No, don't tell me. I don't care."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's start again, please."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...it is no fun being so angry all the time."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Maybe we can just be friends. Keep things casual and cute."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds good to me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River offers you her hand, and when you take it she gives you a firm handshake."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Alright. From now on me and you are cool. I don't need any more stress."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Friends!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/23/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friends!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You... want to Realize me?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "River"
msgid "No more state changes... just a solid, consistent body?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_join/0/16
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh my God... are you actually ready to do this?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_join/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes I am."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_join/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh. Alright."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well... just let me know when you're ready for real."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...are you ready now?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am now. It's time!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, not yet."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Ah. Man, you really know how to get an element's hopes up."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "River"
msgid "See you when you're actually ready, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "First up to be Realized - water itself!"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Okay River, let's see what's downstream..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely water, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/3
msgctxt "River"
msgid "What is this feeling?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River runs her hands up and down her very human body, her fingertips trailing over the contours of her face and sinking into the softness of her cheeks."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/22
msgctxt "River"
msgid "A body... a real body that nobody can change. I'm just me... only me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks at you with tears in her eyes, happier than you've ever seen her."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/38
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Is this what it's like for you? You just walk around feeling whole and complete all the time?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not always—you've just skipped a few steps in life."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your love does make me feel complete..."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tears slip down River's cheeks. When she feels the moisture on her skin she brushes it away with gentle fingers, lifting her hand to inspect it after."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The sight of the tears on her fingers makes her laugh."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Look at that. Human, but still River in the end."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Thank you for everything... I can't wait to start my new life."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_realized/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "River"
msgid "From now on I'm living for me."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River bats her eyelashes at you, drawing you closer with an expression that promises your absolute ruin."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_divert/11
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You know, I think I misspoke earlier. I think I might be missing something after all."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_divert/19
msgctxt "River"
msgid "But I think you know just what I need."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_divert/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She curls her arms around your shoulders, and in this moment there is no denying it—River is human, and she's all woman."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_divert/38
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Why don't we get out of here, lover?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_divert/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River takes an undeniable joy in the sheer humanity of your lovemaking—she worships every inch of your body, and she marvels at what her own can do."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_divert/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She's particularly interested in the marks and signs your body bears after your joining--it's all so new to her, and she treasures every moment."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_divert/65
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When she bids you goodbye the next morning she promises to return to visit, marveling all the while at how consistent her body remains, whether in your arms or in your bed."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River can't seem to leave all the elements too far behind her—at first she craves being near the water. It's all she's known, after all."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She takes up a job as a lifeguard at the local pool, but lifeguarding is stressful work, and she quits a few weeks in."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Not long after that, a chance encounter at one of those make-your-own-candle stores changes the course of River's life and budding career."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_join/24
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...what is this?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_join/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She's fascinated by the way the wax melts and reconstitutes itself—and being the driver, for once, of something else changing states is empowering for River in a way that nothing else has been."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_join/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She finds work as an instructor, leading others through making the candles of their dreams."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_join/48
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Clean Laundry and Freshly Mowed Grass? Sure, why not?"
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_join/56
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Wow, lovely. I wouldn't have thought to pair those scents, but it works so nicely."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_join/64
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh, if you like those, you should try adding a little nutmeg... it'll really bring your scents together."
msgstr ""

#: river_water/river_love_join/72
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She sends you candles from time to time, curating scents to your taste—when you light them you think of River, smiling, now finally indisputably herself... for the rest of her life."
msgstr ""
